# (ferretdb/<arch>/ferretdb-<arch>) and the passwd/group files for the scratch
# image. Everything else (source tree, .git, the .zip) is excluded. This is a
# per-Dockerfile ignore file so it does not affect the source build's .dockerignore.
**
!ferretdb
!build/ferretdb
